From: Xios Project <xios@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] SQLiteDatabase: do not callOnMainThreadAndWait for sqlite3_initialize on the GTK port (deadlocks UI process with the IconDatabase queue)

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/sql/SQLiteDatabase.cpp	2026-10-02 02:18:15
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/sql/SQLiteDatabase.cpp	2026-10-02 02:18:15
@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@
         // aren't confident that it really is, and we still support ancient versions of SQLite. So
         // std::call_once is used to stay on the safe side. See bug #143245.
 
-#if OS(DARWIN)
+#if OS(DARWIN) && PLATFORM(COCOA)
         int ret;
         callOnMainThreadAndWait([&] {
             // In the Network process, this function can be called on a background thread when
